      "message": "B678-B686 publish audited exact flop-call prices and launch six new native boards\n\nIntegrate candidates d2653b3 (Actions 45309479055 PASS) and 7a247e9 (45309479102 PASS). Correct four 33 percent flop-call prices and their seven downstream APPROX SPR values; all 147 complete certified records and all 392 IDs/labels are unchanged. Rank272 retains its explicit one-third model assumption and remains APPROX; it is not asserted equal to native integer-chip b33.\n\nRetain three original rank75 negatives and the three new rank229 negatives. New usable node locks / medium assessments in this publication: 0 / 0. Registry remains 147 CERT-MULTIBOARD / 245 APPROX.\n\nStart rank103 on three distinct flops and rank121 on three connected flops, requiring original two-seat flop/UI reach before downstream GTO and measured NL2 locks. Authenticate completed rank84 root check-call negatives separately with no worker reruns. PR #2 stays draft; do not merge.",
